# Normalize line endings to LF for all text files, regardless of the
# platform or the checkout's core.autocrlf setting. Without this, a Windows
# checkout with the default core.autocrlf=true introduces CRLF line endings
# that make CRLF-sensitive tooling (e.g. mdtoc, invoked by
# dev/tools/verify-toc) report false-positive diffs.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Explicitly mark known binary assets so they are never subject to line
# ending normalization even if git's text/binary heuristic misdetects them.
*.png binary
*.webp binary
